---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 90
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Registry[Versioned workload and model registry]
    Profile[Explicit profile tuples]
    Build[Immutable release build and setup assets]
    Isolation[Fresh database clone, broker scope, owned object storage and HTTP agent]
    Routed[Optional routed database clones]
    Process[Supported release CLI processes]
    ExecState{Linux child has executed?}
    Memory[Child memory observation]
    NoMemory[Skip memory observation]
    Oracle{Exact SQL and immutable-object oracle}
    Sample[Raw timed sample]
    Diagnostics[Post-timing query, buffer, and WAL diagnostics]
    QueryBudget{Absolute statement budget check}
    StatementFailure[Statement budget exceeded]
    DataEvidence[Export stream and per-table page evidence]
    Model{Scaling model acceptance}
    Compare[Counterbalanced baseline/candidate comparison]
    Noise[Canonical same-build noise calibration]
    Capacity[Bounded one/two-worker calibration]
    Deployment[Named workload mix and sourced limits]
    Projection{Capacity projection acceptance}
    Staging[Small staging observation]
    Resident[Resident coordinator and worker]
    Fault[Run-owned dependency restart]
    Reliability{Stability and recovery oracle}
    Actions[Manual, main, nightly, and soak jobs]
    Targets[Reviewed practical targets]
    Budget[Published performance budget]
    Pass[Accepted evidence]
    Informative[Informative evidence]
    Inconclusive[Independent confirmation required]
    Regression[Confirmed performance regression]
    ProductFailure[Product correctness or reliability failure]
    Invalid[Invalid or incomplete]

    Registry --> Profile
    Build --> Isolation
    Profile --> Isolation --> Routed --> Process --> Oracle
    Process --> ExecState
    ExecState -->|kernel flag cleared| Memory --> Oracle
    ExecState -->|pre-exec or unknown| NoMemory
    NoMemory -->|next observation while running| ExecState
    Oracle -->|exact match| Sample
    Oracle -->|product failure| ProductFailure
    Oracle -->|invalid observation| Invalid
    Sample --> Diagnostics
    Sample --> QueryBudget
    Registry --> QueryBudget
    QueryBudget -->|every repetition within ceiling| Pass
    QueryBudget -->|ceiling exceeded| StatementFailure
    QueryBudget -->|missing or inconsistent counters| Invalid
    Sample --> DataEvidence
    Sample --> Model
    Sample --> Compare
    Sample --> Noise
    Sample --> Capacity
    Noise --> Budget
    Targets --> Budget
    Budget --> Compare
    Capacity --> Projection
    Deployment --> Projection
    Staging --> Projection
    Profile --> Resident --> Reliability
    Fault --> Reliability
    Reliability -->|bounded progress and recovery| Pass
    Reliability -->|leak, stall, lost work, or missed deadline| ProductFailure
    Actions --> Profile
    Model -->|residual and repetition pass| Pass
    Model -->|missing or nonlinear evidence| Invalid
    Projection -->|complete bounded evidence| Pass
    Projection -->|nonlinear, saturated, unbounded, or incomplete| Invalid
    Compare -->|within budget or improvement| Pass
    Compare -->|no published budget| Informative
    Compare -->|first over-budget interval| Inconclusive
    Compare -->|confirmed over-budget interval| Regression
    Compare -->|noisy, incompatible, or incomplete| Invalid

    class Registry,Profile,Build,Deployment,Targets component
    class Isolation,Routed,Process,Sample,Resident,Memory system
    class Oracle,Model,Projection,Reliability,QueryBudget,ExecState decision
    class Diagnostics,DataEvidence,Noise,Capacity,Staging,Budget,Compare,Fault,Actions external
    class Pass success
    class Informative,Inconclusive,NoMemory warning
    class Regression,ProductFailure,StatementFailure,Invalid error
